hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"445.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"445.2",""
"446.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"446.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"447.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from 'Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman from A'isha"
"447.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from 'Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman from A'isha"
"448.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from Fatima bint al Mundhir that Asma bint Abi Bakr as-Siddiq said"
"448.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from Fatima bint al Mundhir that Asma bint Abi Bakr as-Siddiq said"
